{
  "id": "vidaa_universal",
  "title": "Sistema Vidaa (Toshiba / Hisense)",
  "parent": "inst_smarttv",
  "description": "Tutorial de instalação para Smart TVs com sistema Vidaa OS.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10 animate-fadeIn'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-tv'></i> Sistema Vidaa OS</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O sistema Vidaa é rápido e moderno, presente em TVs Toshiba e Hisense.</p></div><div class='mb-10 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-800 shadow-2xl animate-fadeIn'><img src='/shared_assets/imagens/smart_tv_toshiba_vidaa.png' alt='Tela Inicial Toshiba Vidaa' class='w-full object-cover'> <p class='bg-[#1c2128] p-4 text-[10px] text-gray-500 uppercase font-black text-center tracking-widest'>Exemplo da Tela Inicial (Interface Vidaa OS)</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4'>Apps na Loja Oficial</h4><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Pesquise na loja de aplicativos da sua TV pelos seguintes players:</p><div class='grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3'><div class='p-3 bg-black/30 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-center font-bold text-blue-400 text-xs'>SmartOne</div><div class='p-3 bg-black/30 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-center font-bold text-blue-400 text-xs'>ClouDDy</div><div class='p-3 bg-black/30 rounded-xl border border-gray-800 text-center font-bold text-blue-400 text-xs'>SSIPTV</div></div><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-4'>O <b>SmartOne</b> e <b>ClouDDy</b> são as melhores opções de performance.</p></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 p-6 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-xl'><h4 class='text-white font-black uppercase tracking-tight mb-4'>Método via DNS</h4><p class='text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-4'>Se preferir usar o nosso app próprio via redirecionamento, altere o DNS da TV para:</p><div class='bg-black/40 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-gray-700 text-center'><p class='text-lg font-black text-blue-400 tracking-tighter'>45.139.122.240</p></div><p class='text-[10px] text-gray-500 mt-4 italic'>Após mudar o DNS, abra o app <b>RedBull TV</b> ou <b>YouTube</b> para carregar o portal.</p></div></section></div>"
  }
}
